@page "/mcp-tools"

<PageTitle>Context Hub | 功能與 MCP API</PageTitle>

<PageViewport Title="功能與 MCP API"
              Subtitle="先用產品功能理解知識協作能力，再查看對應的 MCP、Chat gateway 與 REST API。"
              BodyClass="page-viewport-body mcp-tools-page-body">
    <ChildContent>
        <div class="mcp-tools-page-stack page-scroll-host">
            <section class="panel mcp-capabilities-panel">
                <div class="panel-heading-row">
                    <div>
                        <div class="panel-title">知識協作能力</div>
                        <div class="panel-heading-meta panel-heading-meta-left">所有能力均以授權範圍為前提。以下先說明使用者可得到什麼，再列出可由 agent 或系統呼叫的介面。</div>
                    </div>
                    <span class="status-badge ok">功能導向</span>
                </div>

                <div class="mcp-capability-grid">
                    @foreach (var capability in Capabilities)
                    {
                        <article class="mcp-capability-card">
                            <div class="mcp-capability-header">
                                <div class="stack-item-title">@capability.Name</div>
                                <span class="status-badge @capability.BadgeClass">@capability.Badge</span>
                            </div>
                            <p>@capability.Description</p>
                            <dl class="mcp-capability-details">
                                <div>
                                    <dt>UI</dt>
                                    <dd>@capability.Ui</dd>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <dt>對應 API</dt>
                                    <dd><code>@capability.Api</code></dd>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <dt>註解</dt>
                                    <dd>@capability.Note</dd>
                                </div>
                            </dl>
                        </article>
                    }
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="panel mcp-tools-overview-panel">
                <div class="panel-heading-row">
                    <div>
                        <div class="panel-title">連線面總覽</div>
                        <div class="panel-heading-meta panel-heading-meta-left">`/mcp` 是可信 agent 的完整工具面；`/mcp-chat` 是外部聊天代理的受控 gateway；REST API 供 Dashboard、維運與自動化使用。</div>
                    </div>
                    <span class="status-badge ok">中文說明</span>
                </div>

                <div class="mcp-endpoint-grid">
                    @foreach (var endpoint in Endpoints)
                    {
                        <article class="mcp-endpoint-card">
                            <div class="mcp-endpoint-header">
                                <code>@endpoint.Path</code>
                                <span class="status-badge @endpoint.BadgeClass">@endpoint.Badge</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="stack-item-title">@endpoint.Audience</div>
                            <p>@endpoint.Description</p>
                        </article>
                    }
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="panel">
                <div class="panel-heading-row">
                    <div>
                        <div class="panel-title">Direct MCP 工具</div>
                        <div class="panel-heading-meta panel-heading-meta-left">供 Codex 或內部自動化使用。寫入工具會直接改變 ContextHub durable knowledge，需帶明確 ProjectId 並遵守 repo 規則。</div>
                    </div>
                    <span class="status-badge warn">/mcp</span>
                </div>
                <div class="table-scroll-shell mcp-tools-table-shell">
                    <table class="data-table mcp-tools-table">
                        <thead>
                            <tr>
                                <th>API／工具</th>
                                <th>功能</th>
                                <th>使用方式與限制</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                            @foreach (var tool in DirectTools)
                            {
                                <tr>
                                    <td><code>@tool.Name</code></td>
                                    <td>@tool.Description</td>
                                    <td><span class="status-badge @tool.RiskClass">@tool.Risk</span> @tool.Note</td>
                                </tr>
                            }
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="panel">
                <div class="panel-heading-row">
                    <div>
                        <div class="panel-title">ChatGPT Gateway 工具</div>
                        <div class="panel-heading-meta panel-heading-meta-left">`/mcp-chat` 會依 OAuth actor 與 Project 授權收斂可見範圍；大多數寫入只建立 proposal，由 Dashboard 或 direct MCP 核准後才套用。</div>
                    </div>
                    <span class="status-badge neutral">/mcp-chat</span>
                </div>
                <div class="table-scroll-shell mcp-tools-table-shell">
                    <table class="data-table mcp-tools-table">
                        <thead>
                            <tr>
                                <th>API／工具</th>
                                <th>功能</th>
                                <th>寫入規則與限制</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                            @foreach (var tool in ChatGatewayTools)
                            {
                                <tr>
                                    <td><code>@tool.Name</code></td>
                                    <td>@tool.Description</td>
                                    <td><span class="status-badge @tool.RiskClass">@tool.Risk</span> @tool.Note</td>
                                </tr>
                            }
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="panel">
                <div class="panel-heading-row">
                    <div>
                        <div class="panel-title">REST API 摘要</div>
                        <div class="panel-heading-meta panel-heading-meta-left">Dashboard 與維運腳本使用同一組 Application use cases，不另建平行的 memory API service。</div>
                    </div>
                    <span class="status-badge neutral">/api/*</span>
                </div>
                <div class="table-scroll-shell mcp-tools-table-shell">
                    <table class="data-table mcp-tools-table">
                        <thead>
                            <tr>
                                <th>功能分類</th>
                                <th>REST API</th>
                                <th>功能與註解</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                            @foreach (var api in RestApis)
                            {
                                <tr>
                                    <td>@api.Group</td>
                                    <td><code>@api.Paths</code></td>
                                    <td>@api.Description</td>
                                </tr>
                            }
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="panel mcp-tools-guidance-panel">
                <div class="panel-title">建議操作順序</div>
                <ol class="mcp-tools-flow-list">
                    <li>新任務先用 <code>build_working_context(projectId, query)</code> 建立工作上下文，不要寫入 `default`。</li>
                    <li>需要整理專案殘留時，先跑 <code>project_cleanup_preview</code>，確認候選內容與原因後再套用 <code>project_cleanup_apply</code>。</li>
                    <li>ChatGPT gateway 的寫入應先形成 proposal，透過 <code>chatgpt_proposals_list</code> 檢查，再由有權限的使用者核准。</li>
                    <li>若要永久刪除記憶，優先保留 preview、搬移、封存與核准紀錄；只有確認無保留價值時才用 <code>memory_delete</code>。</li>
                </ol>
            </section>
        </div>
    </ChildContent>
</PageViewport>

@code {
